{
    "title": "Melon Mod for Melon Sandbox PG",
    "description": "Have you ever wondered how to make your own skin / character in Melon Playground? Yes, this app can help you! Now you don\u2019t have to get any other third-party tool just to draw or edit texture color, <b>Melon Mod for Melon Sandbox PG</b> can help you create any character, vehicle, weapon, building or even more!\r\n\r\nOur app is available with many resource packs for you to freely edit skin:\r\n\u2022 Skibidi Toilet Mod Pack\r\n\u2022 Super Bear Adventure\r\n\u2022 Anime mod\r\n\u2022 Doors mod\r\n\u2022 House mod (huge buildings, furniture, elevator,...)\r\n\u2022 Characters / NPC mod\r\n\u2022 War mod (WW2, Tank, Helicopter, Artillery,...)\r\n\u2022 Weapons mod (guns, melee, pistols, lightsaber...)\r\n\u2022 Vehicles mod (Car, Train, Dumper, Bus,...)\r\n\u2022 Zombie mod (Titan, Dinosaurs, T Rex, Venom, Kraken...)\r\n\u2022 Human mod (melon girl mod, woman mod, E-girl, Cat girl,...)\r\nCustomize your game with melon mod skins and show off your style to friends and everyone!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n \u2022  Simple user interface\r\n \u2022  One click to install Melon Playground mods\r\n \u2022  Mod skins for Melon Playground\r\n \u2022  Freely pick color from palette \r\n \u2022  Data will be update weekly\r\n \u2022  Each melsave melmod for melon playground has a short description and images\r\n \u2022  You can find all popular mods, like melon playground doors, Backrooms, SCP, WW2, FNAF, wubbox and many others.\r\nEdit NPC's Skins / Textures for Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox)\r\n\u2022 No need to have another drawing app\r\n\u2022 Work smoothly with any NPC model\r\n\u2022 Perfectly import to game!\r\nThis application requires the Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox) Official Game.\r\n\r\nBring the vanilla Melon Playground world by default to become your own unique playground!\r\n\r\nPREMIUM FEATURES:\r\n \u2022  Install unlimited melon playground mods\r\n \u2022  Unlimited number of mods upload on Community\r\n \u2022  No Ads.\r\n\r\nDownload <b>Melon Mod for Melon Sandbox PG</b> right now and enjoy all new ragdoll playground mods to your game!\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER: This Melon Mod for Melon Sandbox PG is an unofficial application for Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox). The application helps to install and familiarize yourself with the mod for the game Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox), this is not a game, but an add-on with instructions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Have you ever wondered how to make your own skin / character in Melon Playground? Yes, this app can help you! Now you don\u2019t have to get any other third-party tool just to draw or edit texture color, <b>Melon Mod for Melon Sandbox PG</b> can help you create any character, vehicle, weapon, building or even more!<br><br>Our app is available with many resource packs for you to freely edit skin:<br>\u2022 Skibidi Toilet Mod Pack<br>\u2022 Super Bear Adventure<br>\u2022 Anime mod<br>\u2022 Doors mod<br>\u2022 House mod (huge buildings, furniture, elevator,...)<br>\u2022 Characters / NPC mod<br>\u2022 War mod (WW2, Tank, Helicopter, Artillery,...)<br>\u2022 Weapons mod (guns, melee, pistols, lightsaber...)<br>\u2022 Vehicles mod (Car, Train, Dumper, Bus,...)<br>\u2022 Zombie mod (Titan, Dinosaurs, T Rex, Venom, Kraken...)<br>\u2022 Human mod (melon girl mod, woman mod, E-girl, Cat girl,...)<br>Customize your game with melon mod skins and show off your style to friends and everyone!<br><br>FEATURES:<br> \u2022  Simple user interface<br> \u2022  One click to install Melon Playground mods<br> \u2022  Mod skins for Melon Playground<br> \u2022  Freely pick color from palette <br> \u2022  Data will be update weekly<br> \u2022  Each melsave melmod for melon playground has a short description and images<br> \u2022  You can find all popular mods, like melon playground doors, Backrooms, SCP, WW2, FNAF, wubbox and many others.<br>Edit NPC&#39;s Skins / Textures for Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox)<br>\u2022 No need to have another drawing app<br>\u2022 Work smoothly with any NPC model<br>\u2022 Perfectly import to game!<br>This application requires the Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox) Official Game.<br><br>Bring the vanilla Melon Playground world by default to become your own unique playground!<br><br>PREMIUM FEATURES:<br> \u2022  Install unlimited melon playground mods<br> \u2022  Unlimited number of mods upload on Community<br> \u2022  No Ads.<br><br>Download <b>Melon Mod for Melon Sandbox PG</b> right now and enjoy all new ragdoll playground mods to your game!<br><br>DISCLAIMER: This Melon Mod for Melon Sandbox PG is an unofficial application for Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox). The application helps to install and familiarize yourself with the mod for the game Melon Playground (Melon Sandbox), this is not a game, but an add-on with instructions.",
